<span begin="00:31.686" end="00:31.900">from </span><span begin="00:31.900" end="00:32.114">the </span><span begin="00:32.114" end="00:32.330">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.360" end="00:34.580"><span begin="00:32.360" end="00:32.450">The </span><span begin="00:32.450" end="00:32.730">sun </span><span begin="00:32.730" end="00:32.970">doesn't </span><span begin="00:32.970" end="00:33.260">give </span><span begin="00:33.260" end="00:33.500">life </span><span begin="00:33.500" end="00:33.620">to </span><span begin="00:33.620" end="00:33.710">the </span><span begin="00:33.710" end="00:33.980">moon </span><span begin="00:33.980" end="00:34.580">assuming</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.610" end="00:35.900"><span begin="00:34.610" end="00:34.760">The </span><span begin="00:34.760" end="00:34.970">moon's </span><span begin="00:34.970" end="00:35.210">gonna </span><span begin="00:35.210" end="00:35.420">owe </span><span begin="00:35.420" end="00:35.540">it </span><span begin="00:35.540" end="00:35.900">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.990" end="00:37.940"><span begin="00:35.990" end="00:36.080">It </span><span begin="00:36.080" end="00:36.350">makes </span><span begin="00:36.350" end="00:36.530">me </span><span begin="00:36.530" end="00:36.710">think </span><span begin="00:36.710" end="00:36.770">of </span><span begin="00:36.770" end="00:36.860">how </span><span begin="00:36.860" end="00:37.040">you </span><span begin="00:37.040" end="00:37.250">act </span><span begin="00:37.250" end="00:37.340">to </span><span begin="00:37.340" end="00:37.580">me</span><span begin="00:37.580" end="00:37.580">, </span><span begin="00:37.580" end="00:37.640">you </span><span begin="00:37.640" end="00:37.940">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.970" end="00:39.710"><span begin="00:37.970" end="00:38.570">Favors </span><span begin="00:38.570" end="00:38.660">and </span><span begin="00:38.660" end="00:38.780">then </span><span begin="00:38.780" end="00:39.320">rapidly</span><span begin="00:39.320" end="00:39.320">, </span><span begin="00:39.320" end="00:39.440">you </span><span begin="00:39.440" end="00:39.710">just</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.710" end="00:41.570"><span begin="00:39.710" end="00:39.950">Turn </span><span begin="00:39.950" end="00:40.250">around </span><span begin="00:40.250" end="00:40.340">and </span><span begin="00:40.340" end="00:40.610">start </span><span begin="00:40.610" end="00:40.970">asking </span><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.210">me</span><span begin="00:41.210" end="00:41.210">, </span><span begin="00:41.210" end="00:41.570">about</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.660" end="00:43.040"><span begin="00:41.660" end="00:41.990">Things </span><span begin="00:41.990" end="00:42.110">that </span><span begin="00:42.110" end="00:42.200">you </span><span begin="00:42.200" end="00:42.410">want </span><span begin="00:42.410" end="00:42.620">back </span><span begin="00:42.620" end="00:42.770">from </span><span begin="00:42.770" end="00:43.040">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.130" end="00:45.050"><span begin="00:43.130" end="00:43.250">I'm </span><span begin="00:43.250" end="00:43.550">sick </span><span begin="00:43.550" end="00:43.640">of </span><span begin="00:43.640" end="00:43.730">the </span><span begin="00:43.730" end="00:44.180">tension</span><span begin="00:44.180" end="00:44.180">, </span><span begin="00:44.180" end="00:44.480">sick </span><span begin="00:44.480" end="00:44.570">of </span><span begin="00:44.570" end="00:44.630">the </span><span begin="00:44.630" end="00:45.050">hunger</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.050" end="00:46.820"><span begin="00:45.050" end="00:45.300">Sick </span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:45.390">of </span><span begin="00:45.390" end="00:45.560">you </span><span begin="00:45.560" end="00:45.800">acting </span><span begin="00:45.800" end="00:45.920">like </span><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.040">I </span><span begin="00:46.040" end="00:46.220">owe </span><span begin="00:46.220" end="00:46.340">you </span><span begin="00:46.340" end="00:46.820">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.850" end="00:48.530"><span begin="00:46.850" end="00:47.120">Find </span><span begin="00:47.120" end="00:47.360">another </span><span begin="00:47.360" end="00:47.720">place</span><span begin="00:47.720" end="00:47.720">, </span><span begin="00:47.720" end="00:47.810">to </span><span begin="00:47.810" end="00:48.050">feed </span><span begin="00:48.050" end="00:48.170">your </span><span begin="00:48.170" end="00:48.530">greed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.560" end="00:50.150"><span begin="00:48.560" end="00:48.770">While </span><span begin="00:48.770" end="00:48.830">I </span><span begin="00:48.830" end="00:49.100">find </span><span begin="00:49.100" end="00:49.160">a </span><span begin="00:49.160" end="00:49.400">place </span><span begin="00:49.400" end="00:49.520">to </span><span begin="00:49.520" end="00:50.150">rest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.690" end="00:53.060"><span begin="00:50.690" end="00:50.990">I </span><span begin="00:50.990" end="00:51.260">want </span><span begin="00:51.260" end="00:51.410">to </span><span begin="00:51.410" end="00:51.680">be </span><span begin="00:51.680" end="00:51.920">in </span><span begin="00:51.920" end="00:52.760">another </span><span begin="00:52.760" end="00:53.060">place</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.060" end="00:56.690"><span begin="00:53.060" end="00:53.180">I </span><span begin="00:53.180" end="00:53.450">hate </span><span begin="00:53.450" end="00:53.690">when </span><span begin="00:53.690" end="00:53.810">you </span><span begin="00:53.810" end="00:54.350">say </span><span begin="00:54.350" end="00:54.560">you </span><span begin="00:54.560" end="00:55.100">don't</span><span begin="00:55.100" end="00:55.100">, </span><span begin="00:55.100" end="00:56.690">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.690" end="00:57.980"><span begin="00:56.690" end="00:56.833">（</span><span begin="00:56.833" end="00:56.976">You'll </span><span begin="00:56.976" end="00:57.119">see </span><span begin="00:57.119" end="00:57.262">it's </span><span begin="00:57.262" end="00:57.405">not </span><span begin="00:57.405" end="00:57.548">meant </span><span begin="00:57.548" end="00:57.691">to </span><span begin="00:57.691" end="00:57.834">be</span><span begin="00:57.834" end="00:57.980">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.980" end="01:02.060"><span begin="00:57.980" end="00:58.160">I </span><span begin="00:58.160" end="00:58.430">want </span><span begin="00:58.430" end="00:58.580">to </span><span begin="00:58.580" end="00:58.910">be </span><span begin="00:58.910" end="00:59.120">in </span><span begin="00:59.120" end="00:59.390">the </span><span begin="00:59.390" end="01:00.410">energy</span><span begin="01:00.410" end="01:00.410">, </span><span begin="01:00.410" end="01:00.680">not </span><span begin="01:00.680" end="01:00.890">with </span><span begin="01:00.890" end="01:01.190">the </span><span begin="01:01.190" end="01:02.060">enemy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.060" end="01:04.850"><span begin="01:02.060" end="01:02.180">A </span><span begin="01:02.180" end="01:02.480">place </span><span begin="01:02.480" end="01:02.660">for </span><span begin="01:02.660" end="01:02.900">my </span><span begin="01:02.900" end="01:04.850">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.910" end="01:06.830"><span begin="01:04.910" end="01:05.150">Maybe </span><span begin="01:05.150" end="01:05.570">someday </span><span begin="01:05.570" end="01:05.630">I'll </span><span begin="01:05.630" end="01:05.780">be </span><span begin="01:05.780" end="01:06.110">just </span><span begin="01:06.110" end="01:06.350">like </span><span begin="01:06.350" end="01:06.590">you</span><span begin="01:06.590" end="01:06.590">, </span><span begin="01:06.590" end="01:06.830">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin=